<diagram id="index" name="Index and Evidence"><mxGraphModel dx="1500" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2600" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title_1" value="Level 1 Data Flow Diagrams — Module Index" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#16324F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="25" width="2540" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sub_2" value="Disaster Situation Record Management and Situation Report Generation System" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="72" width="2540" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="list_3" value="1.0  Purok User Management
2.0  Barangay User Management
3.0  Purok Profiling
4.0  Barangay Profiling
5.0  Hazard Creation
6.0  Purok Profile Verification
7.0  Barangay Profile Verification
8.0  Purok Incident Reporting
9.0  Purok Incident Report Verification" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FBFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="160" width="1120" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="list_4" value="10.0  Barangay Incident Reporting
11.0  Barangay Incident Report Verification
12.0  Situation Report Generation
13.0  Purok Historical Report Catalog
14.0  Barangay Historical Report Catalog
15.0  Situation Historical Report Catalog
16.0  Log In
17.0  System User Management" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FFFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="160" width="1120" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="refs_5" value="MANDATE / GUIDANCE KEY

[A] RA 10121 §§3, 9, 12 — local monitoring, risk information, hazards, resources, critical infrastructure and response.
[B] DHSUD CDRA guidance — hazard, exposure, sensitivity/vulnerability, adaptive capacity, facilities/lifelines, maps and risk scores.
[C] NDRRMOC SOPG 2024 — Initial/Progress/Terminal/SitRep lifecycle and essential incident information.
[D] DSWD MC 12 s.2026 Annex F — rapid initial situation, affected/displaced population, damaged houses, sources and validation.
[E] RA 10821 §9 and JMC 02 s.2021 — age/sex/ethnicity/special-needs and vulnerable-group data.
[F] RA 10173 — purpose limitation, proportionality, security and restricted personal information.
[G] RA 9470 — government records and version/retention principles." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#B48A00;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="690" width="2420" height="390" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="caveat_6" value="SCOPE NOTE: No national law prescribes this exact Purok-to-Barangay software workflow or a national Purok form. The Level 1 diagrams are researcher-developed decompositions aligned with the confirmed Level 0 module names, local reporting hierarchy, national report contents, CDRA guidance, privacy duties, and the project interview." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#8A5A00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="1140" width="2240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="urls_7" value="Primary sources: lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2010/ra_10121_2010.html  ·  ndrrmc.gov.ph/attachments/article/4125/NDRRMOC_SOPG_2024_EDITION.pdf  ·  dhsud.gov.ph CDRA publications  ·  DSWD MC 12 s.2026  ·  lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2016/ra_10821_2016.html  ·  lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10173_2012.html" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=13;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="1280" width="2340" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
