12" value="Eligible verified Barangay report versions and verification decisions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#244B68;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="store_309" target="proc_296"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="storeflow_313" value="Verified hazard-record versions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#244B68;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="store_310" target="proc_296"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="storeflow_314" value="Existing Situation Report number, version, and status" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#244B68;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="store_311" target="proc_295"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="storeflow_315" value="Situation Report version, frozen source snapshot, approval, release, and export record" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#244B68;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="proc_300" target="store_311"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fields_316" value="&lt;div style='font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#16324F;margin-bottom:8px'&gt;Data-flow dictionary (field groups)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.5'&gt;• Report number/type/version&lt;br&gt;• incident/hazard&lt;br&gt;• reporting cut-off/as-of time&lt;br&gt;• operational period&lt;br&gt;• included source-version snapshot&lt;br&gt;• prevailing situation and chronology&lt;br&gt;• affected/displaced/evacuated population&lt;br&gt;• casualties&lt;br&gt;• houses, infrastructure, agriculture, livelihood and service effects&lt;br&gt;• related incidents&lt;br&gt;• preparedness and response actions&lt;br&gt;• assistance/resources&lt;br&gt;• issues, needs and concerns&lt;br&gt;• recommendations&lt;br&gt;• source notes&lt;br&gt;• reviewer/approver and release/export status&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FBFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="755" width="1220" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rules_317" value="&lt;div style='font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#16324F;margin-bottom:8px'&gt;Validation, controls, and outputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.5'&gt;• Use only eligible verified source versions&lt;br&gt;• Freeze the source snapshot at the cut-off&lt;br&gt;• Do not present generated text as approved&lt;br&gt;• Preserve draft, corrected, approved and released versions&lt;br&gt;• External official submission remains outside system scope unless implemented&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Basis:&lt;/b&gt; NDRRMOC SOPG 2024 pp.52-55,60-70; published NDRRMC SitReps; project interview.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FFFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1325" y="755" width="1220" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note_318" value="Duplicate entity symbols represent the same Level 0 external entity. External entities never connect directly to a data store. Submitted and verified records are versioned rather than silently overwritten." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#B48A00;fontSize=13;align=l