ies never connect directly to a data store. Submitted and verified records are versioned rather than silently overwritten." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#B48A00;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1300" width="2000" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
